panadas and vegan sauce too!!! The impossible empanada and the yellow curry empanada are both SO GOOD! I grew up eating empanadas made by one of my very best Filipino friends and these are on par, super authentic!! I highly recommend you check them out! 10/10 I will definitely be back!! Their Magazine St location is in a bustling part of magazine with nice indoor seating area, a few outdoor seats along magazine, and very nice and clean facilities too. Service was top notch!"},{"business_id":"n8HfcZKc2gmoDQkSI3Csag","review_id":"ikqRgHiTBtp5g_jrv_tBXg","date":"2021-12-06T01:14:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9397497177124023,"text_excerpt":"Finally got the chance to try the new Magazine Street location of this awesome local two-store chain. For locals who are familiar with Natchitoches meat pies, empanadas are their Argentinian counterpart, and Empanola is the New Orleans version of that delicacy! In addition to South American favorites like Peruvian Chicken, Argentinian Beef and Chorizo, you'll find local favorites like crawfish etouffee, gumbo, shrimp and cheese, etc. Plenty of vegetarian options, too. If you're into super sweet, try the bananas foster empanada with chocolate sauce drizzled over it, or a slice of pie from the dessert case. Both times I've been in, they've had a very good tomato basil soup available, too. B..."},{"business_id":"n8HfcZKc2gmoDQkSI3Csag","review_id":"jGeL4DJLIWtAC8Be5dPpJw","date":"2021-12-04T20:36:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9362077713012695,"text_excerpt":"Empanola is a cute like spot on magazine. I love that they have window seats because I like to people watch when I done alone. I order a water, gumbo empanada, the chorizo Mexicana empanada, and the spinach and artichoke empanada. All of the flavors were actually really good. My favorite was the gumbo flavor. Omg l! How the heck did they manage to get all those flavors inside an empanada. I also had the Alfajores treat. I had never had one Before but it was pretty good. It had a caramelly middle with nuts and a soft cookie like outside. Empanola is a must try. I wish I had tried the the bananas Foster flavor."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"n8HfcZKc2gmoDQkSI3Csag","photo_id":"rLuwdHnyUKySh56eaJZ35Q","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/rLuwdHnyUKySh56eaJZ35Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8660794496536255},{"business_id":"n8HfcZKc2gmoDQkSI3Csag","photo_id":"Gz8Q8Ck_AXURglDnCKpbww","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Gz8Q8Ck_AXURglDnCKpbww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8198436498641968},{"business_id":"n8HfcZKc2gmoDQkSI3Csag","photo_id":"LeZi1OQBYQRLPR3IgoVQPw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LeZi1OQBYQRLPR3IgoVQPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.810736894607544}]},"notebook_case":null}
